{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A classic shooter with room to experiment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bleeding</strong> is built on the heart, blood-soaked fun, and brutal charm of classic arena shooters \u2014 but leaves it up to you to choose the pace and your approach to combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As fans of the genre, we wanted to give every player the freedom to create their own perfect, joy-filled way to obliterate enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free and dynamic movement</strong>: Arenas are designed to accommodate any playstyle. Use mobility to dodge damage or dive into enemy crowds. Take strategic positions or stay in constant motion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/976b31f8ec75aa04e6b683c6f83717e7.poster.avif?t=1757369540\" width=1280 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/976b31f8ec75aa04e6b683c6f83717e7.webm?t=1757369540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/976b31f8ec75aa04e6b683c6f83717e7.mp4?t=1757369540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep combat customization</strong>: Access a massive arsenal and unique <strong>implant abilities</strong>. Mix them to radically shape your combat style:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be fast, but fragile</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be slow, but devastatingly powerful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a style that reflects who you are</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlimited tactical variety</strong>: Each weapon shines in specific situations, and implants open endless strategic possibilities. Tune your loadout and abilities for any mission \u2014 or change them completely to refresh your experience when a style grows stale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the environment</strong>: Beyond direct firefights, manipulate the environment against enemies. Push them into crushers, off ledges, explode barrels, or burn them with fire or steam \u2014 every map detail can become a deadly tool.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/28abdcbb5cf624102bfe0732680bc7f2.poster.avif?t=1757369540\" width=1280 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/28abdcbb5cf624102bfe0732680bc7f2.webm?t=1757369540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/28abdcbb5cf624102bfe0732680bc7f2.mp4?t=1757369540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Brutalist World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not a hero \u2014 just a cog that broke loose from a totalitarian machine and now seeks revenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through towering brutalist structures, endless factories, and monumental palaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t succumb to propaganda\u2019s hypnotic slogans \u2014 tear the system apart</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/2c0f08db4fd57db2e2a4e7554db553ec.poster.avif?t=1757369540\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/2c0f08db4fd57db2e2a4e7554db553ec.webm?t=1757369540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/2c0f08db4fd57db2e2a4e7554db553ec.mp4?t=1757369540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game<strong>\u00a0</strong>is currently in early active development. We're focused on building a strong foundation and refining core mechanics. We regularly share progress updates \u2014 stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Add Bleeding to your wishlist to catch the first gameplay showcases, support the studio, and be among the first to receive development news!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844800?t=1757369540","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844800?t=1757369540","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/6daa2033b87afd62d27f4d651a699c732b48e482/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757369540","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/6daa2033b87afd62d27f4d651a699c732b48e482/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757369540","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A classic shooter with room to experiment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bleeding</strong> is built on the heart, blood-soaked fun, and brutal charm of classic arena shooters \u2014 but leaves it up to you to choose the pace and your approach to combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As fans of the genre, we wanted to give every pla