barrels, or burn them with fire or steam \u2014 every map detail can become a deadly tool.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/28abdcbb5cf624102bfe0732680bc7f2.poster.avif?t=1757369540\" width=1280 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/28abdcbb5cf624102bfe0732680bc7f2.webm?t=1757369540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/28abdcbb5cf624102bfe0732680bc7f2.mp4?t=1757369540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Brutalist World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not a hero \u2014 just a cog that broke loose from a totalitarian machine and now seeks revenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through towering brutalist structures, endless factories, and monumental palaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t succumb to propaganda\u2019s hypnotic slogans \u2014 tear the system apart</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/2c0f08db4fd57db2e2a4e7554db553ec.poster.avif?t=1757369540\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/2c0f08db4fd57db2e2a4e7554db553ec.webm?t=1757369540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/2c0f08db4fd57db2e2a4e7554db553ec.mp4?t=1757369540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game<strong>\u00a0</strong>is currently in early active development. We're focused on building a strong foundation and refining core mechanics. We regularly share progress updates \u2014 stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Add Bleeding to your wishlist to catch the first gameplay showcases, support the studio, and be among the first to receive development news!</strong></p>","developers":["Depra"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/a4875824fcadefe25c3f39a6da38064f642878b1/header.jpg?t=1757369540","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257194649,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194649/movie480.mp4?t=1757369538","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194649/movie_max.mp4?t=1757369538"},"name":"BLEEDING Announcement Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194649/d7653751d7b43334f36155adf06fe47e53462a32/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757369538","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194649/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757369538","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194649/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757369538"}}],"name":"BLEEDING","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 Super / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li