,"short_description":"Brutal first-person shooter in a world of savage dieselpunk. Combine abilities for attack, defense, and movement to create your own combat style. In this bloody chaos, there is no mercy. Aggression is your only way to survive.","steam_appid":3844800,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/1253989760926617640/1387828976353017969"},"supported_languages":"English, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}